{"3618600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Olinda Fighters", "steam_appid": 3618600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4889080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over the streets of Olinda during Carnival and brawl your way to victory! Olinda Fighters® is a fast-paced fighting game unlike anything you’ve ever played. Remote Play Compatible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the traditional giant puppets that dance through Carnival parades, the gameplay features a unique spinning attack mechanic that mimics their iconic movements while launching punches at opponents. Players can also “deflate” to dodge incoming attacks and outmaneuver rivals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two exciting game modes — classic rounds or last man standing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle solo against the CPU or with up to 4 players in a chaotic local multiplayer action. It’s a true block-party showdown!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful boosts to increase your attack strength;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab energy drinks to move faster through the crowded parade streets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win three out of five rounds to claim victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your mates online with Steam´s Remote Play Together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite Carnival character from Pernambuco, put your giant head on, and get ready to knock some Olinda puppets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.poster.avif?t=1788298611\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.webm?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.mp4?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/bffb83ce4141ff4a8078e59d6c62d543.poster.avif?t=1788298611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/bffb83ce4141ff4a8078e59d6c62d543.webm?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/bffb83ce4141ff4a8078e59d6c62d543.mp4?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.poster.avif?t=1788298611\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.webm?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.mp4?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.poster.avif?t=1788298611\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.webm?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.mp4?t=1788298611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over the streets of Olinda during Carnival and brawl your way to victory! Olinda Fighters® is a fast-paced fighting game unlike anything you’ve ever played. Remote Play Compatible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the traditional giant puppets that dance through Carnival parades, the gameplay features a unique spinning attack mechanic that mimics their iconic movements while launching punches at opponents. Players can also “deflate” to dodge incoming attacks and outmaneuver rivals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two exciting game modes — classic rounds or last man standing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle solo against the CPU or with up to 4 players in a chaotic local multiplayer action. It’s a true block-party showdown!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful boosts to increase your attack strength;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab energy drinks to move faster through the crowded parade streets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win three out of five rounds to claim victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your mates online with Steam´s Remote Play Together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite Carnival character from Pernambuco, put your giant head on, and get ready to knock some Olinda puppets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.poster.avif?t=1788298611\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/